=2 Walkthrough
__You must zone after completing {q:Getting Lucky|Getting Lucky|Getting Lucky} before you can start this quest.__
* Speak to {p:Cornelia (A)} at (G-12) near Conflux #4 to begin this quest.
* Obtain a {@i:Pursuer's Wing|3267} {i:Pursuer's Wing|Pursuer's Wing|3267} from the {m:Faunus Wyvern} near Conflux #3, or buy it from the Auction House.
* Trade her the {@i:Pursuer's Wing|3267} {i:Pursuer's Wing|Pursuer's Wing|3267} to complete the quest and for your reward.
** 49 quest completions will max fame in this zone.

\**Note**: If you plan to complete this quest multiple times, you will need to zone between each item drop. The most efficient method to repeat this quest is to warp to Conflux #3 -> obtain a {@i:Pursuer's Wing|3267} {i:Pursuer's Wing|Pursuer's Wing|3267} -> warp to Conflux #4 -> accept and turn in the quest -> Warp to Conflux #1 and re-zone.
